.TH tuexpand n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tuexpand
.PP
\fBexpand\fR/\fBunexpand\fR\-like conversion between tabs and spaces in pure Tcl, with correct tab\-stop alignment.
.SS API
.CS
::tclutils::tuexpand::expand   text ?-tabs N?
::tclutils::tuexpand::unexpand text ?-tabs N? ?-all 0|1?
::tclutils::tuexpand::file     path ?-mode expand|unexpand? ?-tabs N? ?-all 0|1?
.CE
.PP
\fB\-tabs\fR sets the tab width (default 8). \fBunexpand\fR converts only leading blanks by default; \fB\-all 1\fR converts blank runs throughout. Single spaces are never turned into tabs.
.SS CLI
.CS
tclsh bin/tuexpand.tcl -tabs 4 file.txt
tclsh bin/tuexpand.tcl unexpand -all 1 file.txt
.CE
